### Description

Whan asking in Agent mode to add additional line of code to existing JS it seems it replaces the whole file with some output that is supposed to be in the chat. The suggestions for the code change is correct, but the edit tool messes up the file.
I have seen this behavior also with qwen3:14b (model where the thinking process is output in the edited file).
Acually it starts changing the file and the messes it up.

